================================================================================
Agent skills — mattpocock/skills
================================================================================

The following directories are copied verbatim from the `skills/productivity`
directory of https://github.com/mattpocock/skills:

    .rulesync/skills/grill-me/
    .rulesync/skills/grilling/
    .rulesync/skills/handoff/
    .rulesync/skills/teach/
    .rulesync/skills/writing-great-skills/

They are vendored rather than fetched because rulesync keys its lockfile by
repository slug alone, so it can track only one path per upstream repo — that
slot is used by `skills/engineering` (see rulesync.jsonc). Skills under
`skills/engineering` are fetched at build time by rulesync and are not committed
to this repository.

